   "icon": "🖍️",
   "lesson": [
    {
     "title": "What is a frequency table?",
     "html": "A <b>frequency table</b> shows <b>how many</b> times each choice happens.<br>We use <b>tally marks</b> to count: four lines, then a slash across makes <b>5</b>."
    },
    {
     "title": "Counting tallies",
     "html": "Count by <b>fives</b> for each group with a slash, then add the extra lines.<br>Example: two full groups and two extra lines = 5 + 5 + 2 = <b>12</b>"
    }
   ],
